	"manualChecklist": [
		{"id":"animation-scale-validation-real-mode-churn","input":"mouse","required":true,"instruction":"With Animation Scale Validation Hero selected in the installed editor, use real mouse input to request Auto, GPU Visual, Hybrid Authoritative, and CPU Deterministic/Fallback through the Animator controls. Inspect the effective mode, fallback reason, batching granularity, publication generations, transfers, readbacks, waits, and bounded mode-switch history in Animation Diagnostics, then restore Auto without collecting timing measurements under the active power limit."},
		{"id":"animation-scale-validation-real-visibility-reload","input":"mouse","required":true,"instruction":"Use real mouse input to hide and show Animation Scale Validation Hero repeatedly, reimport the valid source, and inspect Scene View, Game View, and the authored camera after each transition. Confirm no bind flash, mixed generation, stale deformation, or partial asset publication; leave the valid source, visible object, Auto policy, and stopped editor state restored."},
		{"id":"animation-scale-validation-real-failure-cancellation","input":"keyboard","required":true,"instruction":"Use real keyboard input to review the malformed-reload preservation evidence and canceled-before-commit transaction, then repeat one supported cancellation through the installed animation job UI. Confirm the last-known-good generated package and authored object name remain unchanged and that no canceled work publishes after the protected boundary."},
		{"id":"animation-scale-validation-supported-renderer-recovery","input":"keyboard","required":true,"instruction":"Use only a documented supported installed-editor renderer-loss or recovery procedure, together with the renderer-independent safe-save command and Animation Diagnostics, to verify a usable prior or conservative fallback state and no stale GPU ownership. Do not invent an MCP fault injector or unsafe OS/device action; if no supported procedure is available, do not complete this checklist item and leave animation-validation-us-t-is-clean-blocking-c-completion-us-foundation-installed open. Do not run performance regression measurements under the active power limit."}
	]
